# Narration scratch. `work/` holds one directory per puzzle per run -- prompts,
# raw model replies, intermediate JSON -- and `isolated/` is the staging that
# keeps each reader from seeing the puzzle it is meant to read blind. Both are
# rebuilt by `prepare`/`ingest` and mean nothing after the run that made them.
#
# They were tracked until now, which left five directories in the repo for
# puzzles that no longer exist: the set has been reseeded twice since, so their
# pids match nothing. Published narratives still live in narratives/*.json,
# which is the artefact worth keeping.
narratives/work/
narratives/isolated/
narratives/run1/
